mask_refine.preview_note = Ponelopele e fokolitsoe hore e potlake. Boholo ba meeli bo lekantsoe ka lipikselse tsa tokomane; Sebelisa e sebetsa ka qeto e felletseng. Katametso e holisa ponelopele ena.
mask_refine.duplicate_note = Sephetho: lera le lecha le nang le mebala ea moeli e lokisitsoeng le maske. Lera la pele lea bolokoa ebile lea patoa.
mask_refine.mask_note = Sephetho: maske lereng le sebetsang. Lipikselse tsa lera le khetho ea hona joale lia bolokoa.
mask_refine.no_raster = Khetha lera la raster ho ntlafatsa maske oa lona.
mask_refine.locked = Notlolla lera lena pele u ntlafatsa maske oa lona.
mask_refine.no_mask = Etsa khetho kapa u kenye maske oa lera pele.
mask_refine.changed = Tokomane e fetohile. Koala Ntlafatsa Maske ebe u e bula hape.
mask_refine.rgb_only = Ho tlosa masalla a mebala ho fumaneha bakeng sa lera tsa RGB. Ntlafatso ea maske e sebetsa mokhoeng ona oa mebala.
mask_refine.too_large = Maske o feta moeli o bolokehileng oa memori. Sebelisa tokomane kapa khetho e nyenyane.
mask_refine.processing = E ntlafatsa maske ka qeto e felletseng… U ka hlakola ntle le ho fetola tokomane.
